(6365105, 943063, 117474, '<td valign="top">The framing doesn''t work for me, to the point where it''ll be a 7 rather than 8. Just a little too... offputting or something. I can''t place my finger on it. <br/>It''s hard to say but it might be the outer black border that DPC has on, but regardless I think I''d''ve preferred to have seen more shot than not :)<br/>Love it all the same though.</td>', 'The framing doesn''t work for me, to the point where it''ll be a 7 rather than 8. Just a little too... offputting or something. I can''t place my finger on it. It''s hard to say but it might be the outer black border that DPC has on, but regardless I think I''d''ve preferred to have seen more shot than not :)Love it all the same though.', '2011-03-28 06:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
