(6365122, 942632, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well spotted. Exactly what I''m looking for, a natural environment. Beautiful tones and colors, nicely processed. Great stuff.</td>', 'Well spotted. Exactly what I''m looking for, a natural environment. Beautiful tones and colors, nicely processed. Great stuff.', '2011-03-28 07:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365123, 942817, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nicely spotted scene. Great sky and composition. Well done on finding a natural environment for this.</td>', 'Nicely spotted scene. Great sky and composition. Well done on finding a natural environment for this.', '2011-03-28 07:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365128, 942946, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Found in the environment and an interesting scene with the shape and lines. Nice job on the composition and crop as well.</td>', 'Nicely done. Found in the environment and an interesting scene with the shape and lines. Nice job on the composition and crop as well.', '2011-03-28 07:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365129, 942932, 108069, '<td valign="top">What''s amazing is that I actually do count 13. Nice texture and tones. Great image. I hope the border patrol doesn''t haul you in.</td>', 'What''s amazing is that I actually do count 13. Nice texture and tones. Great image. I hope the border patrol doesn''t haul you in.', '2011-03-28 07:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365131, 942657, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is a simple yet pleasing shot. I like the bit of shading you''ve left, keeping this as a duotone instead of a bw. One of my top pics.</td>', 'This is a simple yet pleasing shot. I like the bit of shading you''ve left, keeping this as a duotone instead of a bw. One of my top pics.', '2011-03-28 07:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365134, 942698, 93565, '<td valign="top">As a whole, I voted down arranged and studio type shots in this challenge, because I thought conceptually they were a cop-out. There is little difficulty in finding 13 of any item and putting them together. This one goes a bit beyond that, having provided a story. I also really am a fan of your lighting. So, good job taking an oft repeated approach and making it your own.</td>', 'As a whole, I voted down arranged and studio type shots in this challenge, because I thought conceptually they were a cop-out. There is little difficulty in finding 13 of any item and putting them together. This one goes a bit beyond that, having provided a story. I also really am a fan of your lighting. So, good job taking an oft repeated approach and making it your own.', '2011-03-28 07:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365135, 942632, 93565, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. I love the shading on the hills, the gloomy sky and the vibrant grass.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. I love the shading on the hills, the gloomy sky and the vibrant grass.', '2011-03-28 07:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365136, 942856, 93565, '<td valign="top">Spooky, brooding. Tells a story far more than the other shots did, and yet ironically maintains more mystery than all the other shots as well. Very nice.</td>', 'Spooky, brooding. Tells a story far more than the other shots did, and yet ironically maintains more mystery than all the other shots as well. Very nice.', '2011-03-28 07:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365137, 942875, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like your abstraction here. The simplicity and focus on form works very well at conveying the topic in a fashion that is refreshingly removed from "here are 13 marbles I own." The abstraction strengthens the idea of having 13 as a subject matter, having removed the object''s identity from things. Good job.</td>', 'I like your abstraction here. The simplicity and focus on form works very well at conveying the topic in a fashion that is refreshingly removed from "here are 13 marbles I own." The abstraction strengthens the idea of having 13 as a subject matter, having removed the object''s identity from things. Good job.', '2011-03-28 07:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365138, 942932, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really appreciate the various textures and tones in your photo. Much more interesting, visually, than many others. You filled the frame, emphasizing the subject with zero negative space, saying "there are 13 objects that fill this frame."</td>', 'I really appreciate the various textures and tones in your photo. Much more interesting, visually, than many others. You filled the frame, emphasizing the subject with zero negative space, saying "there are 13 objects that fill this frame."', '2011-03-28 07:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
