(6365607, 942919, 56502, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s running like mad!</td>', 'Looks like it''s running like mad!', '2011-03-28 18:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365688, 942544, 108069, '<td valign="top">I''m torn with this image. The composition is phenomenal, rich colors. Lighting and processing is how I would do it if I could do it this well. Here''s my beef: It''s almost too cheery. It''s too perfect. I need a bit of gloom and despair in this thing, and it''s certainly there, it''s just not as apparent as it should be in this photo. I certainly won''t knock you for it, as I really, really like this, but maybe burn that mid-level siding a bit and gloom it up, give a slight vignette, make us wonder what''s behind the window that''s partially open, and it''d be on another level. Personally speaking, of course.</td>', 'I''m torn with this image. The composition is phenomenal, rich colors. Lighting and processing is how I would do it if I could do it this well. Here''s my beef: It''s almost too cheery. It''s too perfect. I need a bit of gloom and despair in this thing, and it''s certainly there, it''s just not as apparent as it should be in this photo. I certainly won''t knock you for it, as I really, really like this, but maybe burn that mid-level siding a bit and gloom it up, give a slight vignette, make us wonder what''s behind the window that''s partially open, and it''d be on another level. Personally speaking, of course.', '2011-03-28 19:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365721, 942993, 129091, '<td valign="top">You are my hero for creating an image with 13 wine glasses, especially since so many are against them.  Well I for one love them and I love the assortment of colors and reflections.</td>', 'You are my hero for creating an image with 13 wine glasses, especially since so many are against them.  Well I for one love them and I love the assortment of colors and reflections.', '2011-03-28 20:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
