(6371072, 942698, 16106, '<td valign="top">This could be the basis of a new Hummel figurine, cute to the point that it puts diabetics at risk of spontaneous coma.<br/> <br/>That said, the setup is very good, the lighting is almost perfect (ideal would have had a bit of rim or hair light to define the shadows) and if this is your daughter I encourage you to use her as a model as often as you can while she still likes it. the processing is very deft. On the whole, top 3, if the vote doesn''t go anti-cute it should go blue.</td>', 'This could be the basis of a new Hummel figurine, cute to the point that it puts diabetics at risk of spontaneous coma. That said, the setup is very good, the lighting is almost perfect (ideal would have had a bit of rim or hair light to define the shadows) and if this is your daughter I encourage you to use her as a model as often as you can while she still likes it. the processing is very deft. On the whole, top 3, if the vote doesn''t go anti-cute it should go blue.', '2011-04-02 18:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6371073, 942502, 16106, '<td valign="top">Beautifully seen and rendered. It is such a sober presentation of these sober houses that it is almost comical. Great tones in the sky and water, but the blacks of the trees are a bit blocky on my monitor. Top 3</td>', 'Beautifully seen and rendered. It is such a sober presentation of these sober houses that it is almost comical. Great tones in the sky and water, but the blacks of the trees are a bit blocky on my monitor. Top 3', '2011-04-02 18:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
