(6372152, 942747, 125659, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments! After about 120 out takes for this shot, I finally got one that was worthy enough to get me.. well.. a 5.6. The highlights are a bit distracting and confusing with the DVD outlines as well as the focus being off a little. It was also hard to get the lighting right for the effect but not wash it out more than it did, but it was fun to do and a cool learning experience<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-04 00:46:25.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for the comments! After about 120 out takes for this shot, I finally got one that was worthy enough to get me.. well.. a 5.6. The highlights are a bit distracting and confusing with the DVD outlines as well as the focus being off a little. It was also hard to get the lighting right for the effect but not wash it out more than it did, but it was fun to do and a cool learning experience', '2011-04-04 01:41:29.000000', '2011-04-04 01:46:25.000000', 0),
