(6474414, 942632, 12611, '<td valign="top">Super surreal light here. The eye cannot rest on the green except to find its way to the burrows and cracks, to be forced upward to the windmills. The short area of sky is nice, it forces your eyes back down to repeat the process.</td>', 'Super surreal light here. The eye cannot rest on the green except to find its way to the burrows and cracks, to be forced upward to the windmills. The short area of sky is nice, it forces your eyes back down to repeat the process.', '2011-07-18 14:53:30.000000', NULL, 0),
